35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The weather lost us six weeks. That is a lot of time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,I found that we pay for off-site space when rooms are closed. It is expensive.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The technicians are doing hours of manual checks because the equipment is old.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The older blocks have hazardous materials. That adds months to any project there.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Mechanical costs are up twenty percent. And we have no reserve for replacing old AV kit.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, that sounds dangerous. We should avoid the older blocks if possible.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"The specialist rooms are mostly empty, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"We have unfilled grounds posts, but the new technicians have spare hours.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,Projects that helped everyone rated higher than those for one wing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"So we are paying more for plant, and we are not planning for the future.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The delivery schedules show comfort projects slip, but inspection ones are on time.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"This suggests we need general space, not more specialist suites.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,We could use the spare technician hours for the new work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,A project that benefits the whole campus seems safer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we choose something with high plant costs, the budget will blow up.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We need to be realistic about the weather and the old buildings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,Let us focus on what people actually use.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I agree. We must not ignore the staffing reality.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
